    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af02340b4a4e20202f67ea8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 07:41:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【聊天的人】</span></p><p><span>老圆&amp;白玫瑰（播客《大上海歌舞厅》主播）</span></p><p><span>付宇（播客《轻刀快马》主播）</span></p><p><span>梵一如</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 一场演出竟引万条“举报”？饭圈行为开始侵占公共资源</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 从饭圈逻辑来看，举报电话是“正当维权”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 时代峰峻饭圈与其他饭圈有什么异同吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> “追星”这件事情本身也经历了多个世代更新</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> “流量可变现”时代，让饭圈心态发生了质变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 各个饭圈文化之间情感结构的共性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3425">57:05</a> “诸葛亮为什么是个好偶像？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3970">1:06:10</a> 当消费者意识与现实情感疏离“绞缠”在一起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4410">1:13:30</a> 互动问题：如果宠物会说话，你还会养宠吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4780">1:19:40</a> “圈地自萌”的边界</span></p><p><span>【OP】</span></p><p><span>邹晟栋（童声）</span></p><p><span>RayHan（音乐）</span></p><p><span>【ED】</span></p><p><span>爱 - 小虎队</span></p><p><span>【 Logo 】</span></p><p><span>ZUM XIN</span></p><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><p><span>推荐使用苹果系统自带【播客】APP、【小宇宙】APP或任意安卓播客客户端订阅收听《井户端会议》，也可通过【网易云音乐】、【喜马拉雅】、【荔枝FM】、【蜻蜓FM】等APP收听。</span></p><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><p><span>梵一如</span></p><p><span>【 出品・制作 】</span></p><p><span>番薯剥壳工作室（Yakimo Studio）</span></p>]]></description>
